==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|cu|вънѩти}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*vъnęti}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*vъ(n)-}} (see {{m|sla-pro|*vъ(n)}}) + {{m|sla-pro|*ęti}}. [[Appendix:Glossary#reanalysis|Reanalyzed]] as (and synchronically analyzable as) {{af|ru|в-|-нять}}, from which other words in {{m|ru|-нять}} were created, such as {{m|ru|наня́ть}}, {{m|ru|обня́ть}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-внять.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|внять|pf|impf=внима́ть}}

# {{lb|ru|literary|poetic|or|stilted}} to [[listen]] (to); to [[hear]]; to [[hark]] (to); to [[hearken]]; to [[heed]], to [[pay heed]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вня́ть''' [[молитва|моли́тве]]|to hear the/a prayer}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[почему|Почему́]] [[ты]] [[не]] '''внял''' [[мой|мои́м]] [[совет|сове́там]]?|Why didn't you pay heed to my advice?}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|irreg+p|внять}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|вня́тный}}
** {{l|ru|вня́тно}}
* {{l|ru|внима́ть}}
